[Options]

[A.]
<h2>First Blood</h2>
<i>~y"I looked up at the firey grey clouds above me and through a crack I saw a glimpse of the sun. I knew that if I could somehow rise above the clouds, I would be able to see the entire sun. Yet if I could rise above the sun, and look past its blinding light, I know I would behold the Wind the Rain, and the Thunder as well."~w<br>
--~B~E~y=S~kï~ySPU~w*~y=~rB~g@~yr~mK~b|~rN~gG~yM~m÷~b—~rk~gÍ~yY~mô~.~w</i>
<p>To withstand the brute force of the furies one must be well prepared. Steal the experimental ~B~E~rSuper ~gIsland ~.~w from the  the Iron Warlocks, along with some of their technology.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>You've got the Power</h2>
<p>Now that you have a good offensive platform and a sweet choice of weapons, its time to rally the troops.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,two

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>For the rain...</h2>
<p>Finish the job and become one with the rain.

[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>Down and Out</h2>
<p>Grab the priest and run, hmmm, this ain't that bad of an island...(hint hint)

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Time for Some Tech...</h2>
<p>Your crews return with the report on the rainy isle...They have some newfound technology for you.
$Button=OK,Tell,GetRain

[GetRain]
<$GetTechnology,76>
<$GetTechnology,129>
<$GetTechnology,156>

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>For the Storm...</h2>
<p>The Super Island is almost in your grasp.

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>Quick Power</h2>
<p>Grab the priest and run, hmmm, this is well placed strategically...(hint hint)

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Whats This ?!?!</h2>
<p>In the pocket of the slain enemy you find a blueprind for an experimental flying transport known as a balloon.
$Button=OK,Tell,GetBalls

[GetBalls]
<$GetTechnology,111>

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>For the Wind...</h2>
<p>Finish off this foe and fly amongst the winds.

[ai4TempleDead]
<h2>Quick Like a Bunny</h2>
<p>Grab the priest and run, hmmm, this ain't that bad of an island...(hint hint)

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Time for Some Tech...</h2>
<p>The scouts return with some new knowledge stolen  from the Windy Isle.
$Button=OK,Tell,GetWind

[GetWind]
<$GetTechnology,75>
<$GetTechnology,140>
<$GetTechnology,142>

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>For the Thunder...</h2>
<p>Destroy this dark ruler and add a little power to your inventory.

[ai5TempleDead]
<h2>Shazzam</h2>
<p>Slaughter this priest and crush your foes from afar.

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Time for Some Tech...</h2>
<p>The scouts have arrived home with the new knowledge from the Thunderous Isle.
$Button=OK,Tell,GetThun

[GetThun]
<$GetTechnology,77>
<$GetTechnology,131>
<$GetTechnology,148>


[Failed]
<h2>That Had to Hurt</h2>
<p>As you feel the cold steel sliding through your flesh and into your soul, you pray that the furies will show forgiveness in the afterlife. But thats not bloody likely.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

